          "value": "value"
        },
        {
          "position": [
            241,
            352
          ],
          "type": "text",
          "value": ". Two depots across three days are six rows, and the\nfield names are always those three — the corner cell says "
        },
        {
          "position": [
            352,
            359
          ],
          "type": "inlineCode",
